  "remarks": "LLC NPF ROTOR specialises in the manufacture and supply of pneumatic catapults, scientific research and development in the field of natural and technical sciences. It produces and supplies pneumatic catapults installed on the launch vehicles for the Garpiya-A1 one-way attack UAVs. These UAVs are used by the Russian Armed Forces during Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
